{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21176","headline":"清都夜境 · 元稹","name":"清都夜境","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜久连观静，斜月何晶荧。\n寥天如碧玉，历历缀华星。\n楼榭自阴暎，云牖深冥冥。\n纤埃悄不起，玉砌寒光清。\n栖鹤露微影，枯松多怪形。\n南厢俨容卫，音响如可聆。\n啓圣发空洞，朝真趋广庭。\n闲开蘂珠殿，暗阅金字经。\n屏气动方息，凝神心自灵。\n悠悠车马上，浩思安得宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}